  "body": "If you are looking for a spacious family home or a highly reliable rental investment in Stanmore Bay, your search ends here. With the vendors heading overseas, motivation is at an all-time high, resulting in significant price reductions to secure a fast sale. Now priced at an incredibly sharp $779,000, this property offers outstanding value for money that is virtually impossible to beat in the current market.\r\n\r\nTucked away in the peaceful, tree-lined pocket of Brookvale Park, this bright, standalone home is perfectly suited to buyers needing extra room or landlords looking for a smart addition to their portfolio. The generous floor plan effortlessly accommodates modern living, offering flexibility, privacy, and excellent indoor-outdoor flow for summer entertaining.\r\n\r\nKey Features for Buyers & Investors:\r\n\r\n• Massive Floor Size & Versatility: 150sqm approx, features 3 double bedrooms, a spacious open-plan kitchen/dining area, a separate lounge, plus a bonus rumpus or home office space to suit growing families or working from home\r\n\r\n• Prime Location: Situated in the heart of Stanmore Bay. Enjoy proximity to stunning local beaches, everyday amenities, Stanmore Bay School, Whangaparaoa College, and the highly anticipated Penlink transport connection.\r\n\r\n• Outstanding Value for Money: Recently reduced to $779,000 to meet the market immediately. Tidy and more than liveable as it is, also offering the potential to add value at this price.\r\n\r\n• Reliable Rental Investment: A proven layout and highly sought-after location make this an incredibly attractive property for quality tenants. It is tidy, low-maintenance, and ready to generate rental income right away.\r\n\r\n• High Vendor Urgency: The vendors are moving overseas and their instructions are clear: present all serious interest immediately. They are highly motivated to sell now.\r\n\r\n• Ample Parking & Storage: Includes off-street parking for 3 cars, massive under-house storage for tools and toys, plus a garden shed.\r\n\r\n• Year-Round Comfort: Flooded with natural light and equipped with two heat pumps to stay dry, warm or cool in those summer months\r\n\r\nDeals this good do not last. Investors and owner-occupiers must act swiftly to secure this spacious, very sharply priced property.\r\n\r\nCall today to arrange an immediate private viewing or visit the Open Home this weekend!",
